# A file without a final newline has no line past its last.
args: show github.com/evilmartians/lefthook@cc9969c2e2198aafff8accc63ee1aee30e9a2aa4:.typos.toml 5-6
exit: 0
--- stdout
github.com/evilmartians/lefthook@cc9969c2e219:.typos.toml  no lines 5-6; the file has 4
--- stderr
sego: note: no lines 5-6; the file has 4
